 your best weapon against the entities that lurk in the dark is your knowledge. Find out how they behave in order to avoid restarting the cycle again and again.</p>","developers":["PV Development"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033410/be3b2249206e6185c216e0af1c39ec1bea5db055/header.jpg?t=1761069456","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4033410/871751211/a97e692169b2d2f3859b70427394cb970bfd7533/1758050113/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758291332","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4033410/871751211/a97e692169b2d2f3859b70427394cb970bfd7533/1758050113/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758291332","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4033410/871751211/a97e692169b2d2f3859b70427394cb970bfd7533/1758050113/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758291332","id":257198925,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198925/movie480.mp4?t=1758291332","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198925/movie_max.mp4?t=1758291332"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257198925/d672ecd80d8b4bbaef089e308c0ab359d97e865e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758291332","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198925/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758291332","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198925/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758291332"}}],"name":"The Rite Holds","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"fal